          "description": "The walk, minute by minute, leaving home at 7:00: the bars count the needs that come within reach at each minute, cell by cell. Drag the window's end, or press play to grow it from the first minute to fifteen; the map, the figures and the charts follow at every step.",
          "id": 2,
